#: ../../../advanced/folder-ignoredelete.rst:2
msgid "ignoreDelete"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/folder-ignoredelete.rst:4
msgid ""
"``ignoreDelete`` is an advanced folder setting that affects the handling of "
"incoming index updates. When set, incoming updates with the delete flag set "
"are ignored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/folder-ignoredelete.rst:8
msgid "This option should normally be set to ``false``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/folder-ignoredelete.rst:11
msgid "Example Scenario"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/folder-ignoredelete.rst:13
msgid ""
"Assume two devices, \"Alice\" and \"Bob\", are sharing a folder. Bob has set "
"``ignoreDelete``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/folder-ignoredelete.rst:16
msgid ""
"New and updated files are synchronized as usual between Alice and Bob. When "
"Bob deletes a file, it is deleted for Alice as well. When Alice deletes a "
"file, Bob ignores that update and does not delete the file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/folder-ignoredelete.rst:20
msgid ""
"In this state, Bob is fully up to date from his own point of view, as is "
"Alice from her own point of view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/folder-ignoredelete.rst:23
msgid ""
"However from the point of view of Alice, who deleted a file and propagated "
"the update, Bob is now out of date because he is yet to remove the file that "
"was deleted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/folder-ignoredelete.rst:27
msgid ""
"From the point of view of Bob, who ignored the delete entry from Alice, "
"Alice is now out of date because she is missing the file that was deleted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/folder-ignoredelete.rst:31
msgid ""
"Bob may continue to see Alice as up to date until the next time Syncthing is "
"restarted on his device."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/folder-ignoredelete.rst:34
msgid ""
"Should Bob modify any of the files that Alice has deleted, the update will "
"be sent to Alice and Alice will download the now updated file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/folder-ignoredelete.rst:38
msgid ""
"Ignoring deletes in both directions between two devices can be a confusing "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
